265
00:16:36,205 --> 00:16:40,100
I'll take a souvenir with me too,
just in case.

266
00:16:41,820 --> 00:16:43,660
Excuse me, are you really alright?

267
00:16:43,660 --> 00:16:45,840
Please don't go to any trouble.

268
00:16:53,700 --> 00:16:55,540
Bad timing

269
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:57,680
Let's go with a different plan.

270
00:16:57,680 --> 00:16:59,520
Well then, beer with the bento -

271
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:01,340
Yes, beer with the bento, right?

272
00:17:03,420 --> 00:17:04,380
This can be used.

273
00:17:05,020 --> 00:17:05,600
No way.

274
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:10,840
No way, I'm not doing that.

275
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:11,800
Then what exactly are you...?

276
00:17:13,660 --> 00:17:13,860
Is that okay?

277
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:15,720
Th-that's...

278
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:17,580
Hey, you. Over here.

279
00:17:17,580 --> 00:17:18,160
Yes?

280
00:17:20,820 --> 00:17:23,760
I have a favor to ask.
Would you mind listening?

281
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:25,520
Y-yes!

282
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:36,480
Would you like some beer with your bento?

283
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:41,220
The newspaper's in the way, so they can't see.
Now's my chance!

284
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:45,900
Whaaaaat?

285
00:17:46,700 --> 00:17:48,680
Whaaaaat?

286
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:59,100
Damn, you've got a fine pair of tits, lady.

287
00:17:59,100 --> 00:18:00,340
What do you think you're doing?

288
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:05,700
Hey, Grandpa,
sexual harassment isn't allowed.

289
00:18:05,700 --> 00:18:07,920
Come on, what's the harm, sweetheart?

290
00:18:08,660 --> 00:18:09,460
Well, well.

291
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:11,520
Rustle rustle.

292
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:13,040
Knock it off already, please.

293
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:14,660
W-what the hell are you doing, you bastard?

294
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:17,760
Violence against the
elderly isn't cool, is it?

295
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:21,060
You look like someone I've seen somewhere.

296
00:18:21,060 --> 00:18:22,260
It's your imagination.

297
00:18:22,740 --> 00:18:23,270
Right,

298
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:27,240
people often tell me I look like
the one on the right from Puffy.

299
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:29,680
No, I think you look like someone I know.

300
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:33,080
Hey, you, how much is this?

301
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:34,780
That one's not for sale.

302
00:18:34,780 --> 00:18:35,780
That voice just now...

303
00:18:35,780 --> 00:18:38,020
What do you mean, not for sale?

304
00:18:38,260 --> 00:18:40,920
It's displayed right here,
so it must be for sale.

305
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:41,960
No, well, that...

306
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:44,060
So what is it?
How much are you selling it for?

307
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:47,320
I'll sell it. It's 100 yen.

308
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:51,020
What? You sold that already?!

309
00:18:51,860 --> 00:18:53,360
I had no choice.

310
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:55,560
If I'd stayed like that,
I was about to get caught any second.

311
00:18:55,560 --> 00:18:58,600
Damn that old geezer,
always getting in the way.

312
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:01,180
After all,
there's no way to get a proper run-up.

313
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:04,440
Alright, this time I'll go.

314
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:06,380
At this point, it's close combat.

315
00:19:10,020 --> 00:19:13,060
Is it about 30 more minutes until Hamamatsu?

316
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:14,160
Excuse me.

317
00:19:15,740 --> 00:19:17,800
Is the seat next to you free? Arka?

318
00:19:18,520 --> 00:19:19,360
Yes, go ahead.

319
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:23,400
I'm Mr. Carton,
a tenth-generation Japanese, arka.

320
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:24,800
Nice to meet you.

321
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:28,960
Have we met somewhere? Arka?

322
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:30,720
Haven't we met somewhere?

323
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:32,900
This is my first time, arka, really.

324
00:19:33,740 --> 00:19:35,920
The Hamanako monster, Hamashiga!

325
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:38,760
No, wait, it was a giant eel.

326
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:40,960
Suddenly I remembered four o'clock.

327
00:19:41,580 --> 00:19:42,740
I'm very busy

328
00:19:42,740 --> 00:19:49,300
Hey, miss, excuse me,
may I see your ticket, please?

329
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:58,200
Ticket... there's a white bear and all that...
that's the Arctic Circle, you idiot... I'm from Shimura Prefecture.

330
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:02,400
Totally different from the
water-system fan I shouted...

331
00:20:03,260 --> 00:20:08,480
You took my bag too, senpai. Nice work.

332
00:20:11,220 --> 00:20:12,360
Hold it right there!

333
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:13,380
Hey, wait up!

334
00:20:16,220 --> 00:20:18,080
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!

335
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:19,040
Give it back, you!

336
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:19,700
Oi!

337
00:20:19,780 --> 00:20:20,340
Stop right there!

338
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:20,980
King of Drama!

339
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:22,980
We got this far just to get caught, damn it!

340
00:20:22,980 --> 00:20:23,420
Hey!

341
00:20:29,620 --> 00:20:30,740
What, the drama king!

342
00:20:35,820 --> 00:20:37,780
Lady, hurry up and move!

343
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:39,260
You can't get past like that, can you?! Hey!

344
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:42,300
It's like I'm the fat one here, isn't it?

345
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:43,820
Honestly, you two are

346
00:20:43,820 --> 00:20:44,440
Me

347
00:20:45,740 --> 00:20:46,540
Well then

348
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,680
What are you doing?

349
00:20:52,340 --> 00:20:53,300
Excuse me

350
00:20:57,080 --> 00:20:58,660
My souvenir...

351
00:20:59,180 --> 00:21:02,620
Still, that guy just
now looked like someone.

352
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:20,940
Come on, cut it out!

353
00:21:20,940 --> 00:21:21,900
Nakagawa!

354
00:21:21,900 --> 00:21:22,220
Yes!

355
00:21:24,620 --> 00:21:25,480
What?

356
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:28,660
Eeeeeeeh!

357
00:21:30,520 --> 00:21:31,880
Eeeeeeeh!

358
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:32,580
Eeeeeeeh!

359
00:21:32,580 --> 00:21:33,120
Eeeeeeeh!

360
00:21:33,120 --> 00:21:33,880
Eeeeeeeh!

361
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:36,060
Eeeeeeeh!

362
00:21:36,060 --> 00:21:37,360
Eeeeeeeh!

363
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:58,080
Mission over.

364
00:21:58,080 --> 00:21:59,820
Wrap it up already.

365
00:22:00,320 --> 00:22:00,800
Young master.

366
00:22:00,800 --> 00:22:02,060
The bullet train is currently

367
00:22:02,060 --> 00:22:03,980
cruising at top speed.

368
00:22:03,980 --> 00:22:04,960
It's too dangerous.

369
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:09,240
We're going to enter Toyohashi city!

370
00:22:10,340 --> 00:22:12,000
This is going to cause a huge uproar.

371
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:14,220
Yamoe, use your trump card.

372
00:22:14,220 --> 00:22:14,960
Roger.

373
00:22:15,720 --> 00:22:17,460
What do you plan to do with your trump card?

374
00:22:18,300 --> 00:22:19,460
Just watch.

375
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:27,380
It's launched!

376
00:22:34,120 --> 00:22:34,620
What?

377
00:22:34,660 --> 00:22:35,080
What? What's that smoke?

378
00:22:35,080 --> 00:22:36,280
Brakes!

379
00:22:41,840 --> 00:22:42,480
I see.

380
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:44,000
I already did that just now.

381
00:22:53,020 --> 00:22:55,160
We finally got the photo back!

382
00:22:56,860 --> 00:23:00,220
Senpai, it's dangerous here. Let's
get back inside the helicopter quickly.

383
00:23:00,460 --> 00:23:01,120
Yeah.

384
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:09,180
Whew, that was close. Just barely!

385
00:23:11,900 --> 00:23:12,860
Hey, you've got to be kidding!

386
00:23:16,140 --> 00:23:17,460
Yes!

387
00:23:23,300 --> 00:23:25,360
My photo!

388
00:23:30,860 --> 00:23:32,040
Hair's coming down!

389
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:33,600
What's this supposed to be advertising?

390
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:39,820
What an outrageous commotion.

391
00:23:40,960 --> 00:23:42,400
It's a case of a thrill-seeking criminal,
isn't it.

392
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:45,900
The culprit gets a kick out
of getting into the newspapers,

393
00:23:45,900 --> 00:23:48,260
so he's doing these vulgar things.

394
00:23:48,960 --> 00:23:52,420
Still, the culprit's a hopeless idiot.

395
00:23:52,420 --> 00:23:55,440
I don't think they did
it just for fun, though.

396
00:24:03,760 --> 00:24:05,020
Where did it go?

397
00:24:05,460 --> 00:24:07,740
Chief, have you seen my daifuku?

398
00:24:08,260 --> 00:24:09,260
You ate it, didn't you?

399
00:24:09,820 --> 00:24:11,200
Why did you go and eat it, Chief!

400
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:13,880
That was my precious food supply!

401
00:24:14,160 --> 00:24:16,220
Shall we make you pay for it properly!

402
00:24:16,360 --> 00:24:17,060
As a human being!

403
00:24:17,820 --> 00:24:20,260
Next time, I'll risk my life!
All-you-can-eat!

404
00:24:20,700 --> 00:24:21,340
Thanks in advance!

405
00:24:31,140 --> 00:24:37,320
People gossip that I'm a
woman who can't fall in love,

406
00:24:37,320 --> 00:24:43,000
but I have mountains of things I want to do.

407
00:24:44,740 --> 00:24:52,020
I want to ride a motorcycle
across the vast desert,

408
00:24:52,020 --> 00:24:59,400
I want to be freer than a bird.

409
00:25:29,220 --> 00:25:30,020
Wait for me.

